=2 Walkthrough
* Before heading out, get an {@i:Acidic Humus|2948} {i:Acidic Humus|Acidic Humus|2948} and a {@i:Watermelon|4491} {i:Watermelon|Watermelon|4491} for each member of your party.
** {@i:Acidic Humus|2948} {i:Acidic Humus|Acidic Humus|2948} can be farmed in {z:Abyssea - Tahrongi}.
*** Warp to conflux #2 and walk north.
*** Fight {m:Pachypodiums|Pachypodium} until you get an {@i:Alkaline Humus|2920} {i:Alkaline Humus|Alkaline Humus|2920} **{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}**.
*** Trade the {@i:Alkaline Humus|2920} {i:Alkaline Humus|Alkaline Humus|2920} to the __???__ spot on the eastern side of (H-8) to spawn {m:Gancanagh}, who drops the {@i:Acidic Humus|2948} {i:Acidic Humus|Acidic Humus|2948} **{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**.
** You may also buy the {@i:Acidic Humus|2948} {i:Acidic Humus|Acidic Humus|2948} from the auction house (Others > Misc. 2).
** {@i:Watermelon|4491}{i:Watermelon|Watermelon|4491} can be bought from {n:Scamplix} near HP#2 in {z:Rabao} (F-7).
* Talk to the {n:Mandragora Warden} in {z:The Boyahda Tree}, Map 1 at (F-4), and ask about Magh Bihu.
** There are two spots at (F-4) with {n:Mandragora Warden}. The correct one has an entrance from E-4.
** There is only a single Mandragora Warden at the correct location.
** The {p:Proto-Waypoint} is closest.
** The next fastest way to reach it is by using the {p:Home Point} near the Cloister and walking towards exit F to the north.
** Unity Warp level 135 to The Boyahda Tree is another way very close to it.
* Trade an {@i:Acidic Humus|2948} {i:Acidic Humus|Acidic Humus|2948} for a cutscene.
* After the cutscene, speak to {n:Mandragora Warden} again and select "**Where did Magh Bihu go?**".
* Trade a {@i:Watermelon|4491} {i:Watermelon|Watermelon|4491} for the final cutscene and your reward.

